{
  "id": "cmd-sephiroth",
  "name": "Sephiroth — Aristocrats",
  "description": "Commander, mono-black, based on the list \"Sephiroth's Singularity\" by Grumpywolf (Moxfield, bracket 4: nine Game Changers, among them Necropotence, Bolas's Citadel, Demonic Tutor, Orcish Bowmasters and The One Ring). Sephiroth, Fabled SOLDIER turns every death into drain and card draw: sacrifice outlets (Ashnod's Altar, Phyrexian Altar, Viscera Seer), death triggers (Blood Artist, Zulaport Cutthroat, Drivnod), recursion (Gravecrawler, Reassembling Skeleton, Mortuary) and edicts.",
  "fr": {
    "name": "Sephiroth — Aristocrates",
